|-
! !! Masculine singular or feminine singular !! Neuter singular !! Plural (any gender)
|-
! Definite<br />(with definite article<br />or pronoun)
| {{lang|nl|de mooi'''e''' fiets}} ("the beautiful bicycle")<br />{{lang|nl|onze mooi'''e''' fiets}} ("our beautiful bicycle")<br />{{lang|nl|deze mooi'''e''' fiets}} ("this beautiful bicycle")
| {{lang|nl|het mooi'''e''' huis}} ("the beautiful house")<br />{{lang|nl|ons mooi'''e''' huis}} ("our beautiful house")<br />{{lang|nl|dit mooi'''e''' huis}} ("this beautiful house")
